Guy!


01:21:15.079 --> 01:21:18.742
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:18.983 --> 01:21:22.749
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:24.222 --> 01:21:27.282
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:27.458 --> 01:21:30.052
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:30.228 --> 01:21:31.786
Let's try this again.


01:21:31.996 --> 01:21:33.861
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:35.433 --> 01:21:38.163
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:03.828 --> 01:22:06.058
Hey. Clear.


01:22:21.746 --> 01:22:23.907
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:24.081 --> 01:22:26.447
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:08.326 --> 01:23:10.920
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:11.095 --> 01:23:13.962
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:18.936 --> 01:23:22.463
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:28.913 --> 01:23:30.972
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:36.153 --> 01:23:40.453
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:44.895 --> 01:23:47.887
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:48.065 --> 01:23:50.192
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:09.687 --> 01:24:11.552
I love my life.


01:24:11.722 --> 01:24:13.917
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:36.380 --> 01:24:39.577
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

